\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>两种性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"45e20be1a6b32031\" href=\"?note=45e20be1a6b32031\" title=\"56-df-church-rosser\">56-df-church-rosser</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{ChurchRosser}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{ChurchRosser}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书证明已核对。Church–Rosser方向直接适用于共同起点形成的转换。反向按有限转换链长度归纳；追加反向步时共同后继不变，追加正向步时用合流合并新端点和已有共同后继。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-church-rosser","status":"resolved","id":"45e20be1a6b32031","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-church-rosser]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","s